    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buckle Up!</strong> is a 2\u20136 player online party shooter where quick matches and unpredictable moments keep everyone on their toes. Jump into fast-paced rounds with friends or strangers, switch up your strategy on the fly, and try not to fall off the train.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match brings a new challenge, with different gamemodes, weapons to upgrade, and plenty of ways to mess with your opponents. Win by scoring points, outplaying your rivals, or just staying on board a little longer than everyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/bd80290c7b5f882cc18a8a781050a5d7.avif?t=1753293282\" width=616 height=127 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/d6625ac7040472faa790fb3c324dc3a8.poster.avif?t=1753293282\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/d6625ac7040472faa790fb3c324dc3a8.webm?t=1753293282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/d6625ac7040472faa790fb3c324dc3a8.mp4?t=1753293282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the chaos with up to 6 players in online multiplayer. Play with friends or find new rivals in public lobbies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/f8b5898665e8eeb40356ba1098a82138.avif?t=1753293282\" width=616 height=127 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/d098fcd9d1d2347ffbc59de2ea8b8ba4.poster.avif?t=1753293282\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/d098fcd9d1d2347ffbc59de2ea8b8ba4.webm?t=1753293282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/d098fcd9d1d2347ffbc59de2ea8b8ba4.mp4?t=1753293282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're stealing flags, holding hills, dodging players with bombs, or just going full deathmatch, there's always a new way to win or lose!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/c7e717b7cb12b80d79be7ac0f2dad412.avif?t=1753293282\" width=616 height=127 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/e9984c7cd778bb7993ab19b61510be3b.poster.avif?t=1753293282\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/e9984c7cd778bb7993ab19b61510be3b.webm?t=1753293282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/e9984c7cd778bb7993ab19b61510be3b.mp4?t=1753293282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect upgrades for your weapons mid-match. Adapt on the fly with special weapons and game-changing pickups then unleash chaos on your competition.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/ecc545a088ec7d52e1d64db1918bfd7a.avif?t=1753293282\" width=616 height=127 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/5b8d23a893d1ca255c619047ec2e0477.poster.avif?t=1753293282\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/5b8d23a893d1ca255c619047ec2e0477.webm?t=1753293282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/5b8d23a893d1ca255c619047ec2e0477.mp4?t=1753293282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outplay your friends, grab the high score, and fight for the top spot.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/ecb897c376f4488609eb067f155c590a.avif?t=1753293282\" width=616 height=127 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/4f7b3876f36643d5cd1622272ab1ae50.poster.avif?t=1753293282\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/4f7b3876f36643d5cd1622272ab1ae50.webm?t=1753293282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/4f7b3876f36643d5cd1622272ab1ae50.mp4?t=1753293282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your personality with customizable outfits and characters. From stylish to downright ridiculous.</p></li></ul>",
